{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","x":-60,"y":-310,"width":900,"height":190,"text":"# EXPLOSIVES\nThe core thrown-grenade procedure is LOCKED: PLACE → WAIT/FUSE → REACT → DETONATE → TRACE GEOMETRY → RESOLVE EFFECT. Specialized families can expand this common physical framework later.","color":"2"},{"id":"back","type":"file","x":-60,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":130,"file":"Maps/Combat.canvas","color":"6"},{"id":"hub","type":"file","x":390,"y":-80,"width":360,"height":130,"file":"Hubs/Explosives.md","color":"2"},{"id":"g-flow","type":"group","x":-100,"y":180,"width":3200,"height":850,"label":"LOCKED GRENADE FLOW","color":"2"},{"id":"skill","type":"file","x":80,"y":400,"width":360,"height":180,"file":"Character/Skills/GRENADES.md","color":"2"},{"id":"grenade","type":"file","x":520,"y":400,"width":360,"height":180,"file":"Explosives/GRENADE.md","color":"2"},{"id":"placement","type":"file","x":960,"y":400,"width":400,"height":180,"file":"Explosives/GRENADE PLACEMENT.md","color":"2"},{"id":"fuse","type":"file","x":1440,"y":400,"width":380,"height":180,"file":"Explosives/FUSE TIMING.md","color":"2"},{"id":"save","type":"file","x":1900,"y":400,"width":400,"height":180,"file":"Explosives/EXPLOSIVE SAVE.md","color":"2"},{"id":"blast","type":"file","x":2380,"y":400,"width":420,"height":180,"file":"Explosives/BLAST GEOMETRY.md","color":"2"},{"id":"g-later","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1130,"width":3200,"height":650,"label":"LATER FAMILY / CONTENT EXPANSION","color":"6"},{"id":"later","type":"text","x":150,"y":1300,"width":2700,"height":330,"text":"## Core procedure is no longer parked\nThe initial balance-suite reference families are **FRAGMENTATION · FLASH / CONCUSSION · SMOKE**. Their exact radii, DAMAGE / target PENETRATION / MATERIAL PENETRATION, status-effect strength, persistence and other values remain balance/reference work.\n\nFuture dedicated content may add **MINES · DIRECTIONAL CHARGES · SATCHELS · INCENDIARY · EMP · DEMOLITION · THROWBACK** and other devices without changing the locked common grenade flow.\n\nEXPLOSIVE SAVE remains an explosive-resolution procedure, not a universal reaction or OVERWATCH system.","color":"6"}],"edges":[{"id":"skill-grenade","fromNode":"skill","fromSide":"right","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"grenade","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},{"id":"grenade-place","fromNode":"grenade","fromSide":"right","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"placement","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},{"id":"place-fuse","fromNode":"placement","fromSide":"right","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"fuse","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},{"id":"fuse-save","fromNode":"fuse","fromSide":"right","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"save","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"if warning allows response"},{"id":"save-blast","fromNode":"save","fromSide":"right","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"blast","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},{"id":"fuse-blast","fromNode":"fuse","fromSide":"bottom","fromEnd":"none","toNode":"blast","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"no response window"}]}